{"unit_id": "tag:01HR:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在《层（Sheaves）》一章的第<REF_0001>节中，我们定义了基（basis）上的层（sheaf），并证明了这一概念与空间（space）上的层（sheaf）的概念实质上等价（equivalent），见《层（Sheaves）》一章的引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>。此外，我们在《层（Sheaves）》一章的引理<REF_0004>中证明，对每个标准开集（standard open），只需检验层条件（sheaf condition）在由开集（open）组成的覆盖（coverings）的一个共尾（cofinal）系统上是否成立。由上面的引理，只需对由标准开集（standard opens）组成的有限（finite）覆盖（coverings）进行检验。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "cofinal", "target_term": "共尾"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "被引章节名"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "定义层所用的拓扑基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "定义在基上"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "层所定义的空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "定义在空间上"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "比较两种层的概念"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "被引章节名"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "被引章节名"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "逐一检验层条件的开集"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件", "context": "需检验的条件"}, {"source_ter