{"unit_id": "tag:01HY:proof", "translation": "考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n（关于<MATH_0002>-映射（maps）的讨论，见《层（Sheaves）》一章定义<REF_0001>之后的内容）。\n由于右侧的竖直箭头是局部（local）的，可知<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的逆（inverse）像（image）。由此得到结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "证明中所考虑的图"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "被引讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "被引章节名"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "右侧竖直箭头作为环映射的性质"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "与像连用表示逆像"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "与逆连用表示逆像"}], "notes": []}
